      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "World creators can already do this. And as an custom avatar creator, I find it rather annoying when anything is in front of mirrors. I need to be able to view my avatar on a 100% clean mirror to know what others see. It helps find weight painting issues and problems with animations in the rig.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
